      "writtenOn": "2021-08-19T16:04:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "image.sample() is very interesting, because it opens us up to allowing richer interaction with Skia types bound to SkSL effects. (This is also how HLSL has worked for a while - texture2D is an object with several different method calls).",
